Looking at the error, the issue is that `QRcode_encodeInput` expects `*mut libqrencode_raw::src::qrencode::_QRinput` but we're passing `*mut libqrencode_raw::src::qrinput::_QRinput`. Similarly, `Split_splitStringToQRinput` and `QRcode_encodeInputStructured` likely have the same cross-module type issue. I need to cast pointers at call boundaries.

